//   8.0  match · named args · attributes · promotion · throw-expr ·
//        nullsafe · ::class-on-object · catch-no-var · union types
//   8.1  enums · readonly props · never · FCC '(...)' · intersection ·
//        new-in-initializers (no schema impact) · 0o octal
//   8.2  readonly classes · DNF · ${} deprecation · 'true/false/null' types
//   8.3  typed class constants · readonly anon classes
//   8.4  property hooks · asymmetric visibility · new-without-parens chains
//   8.5  pipe '|>'
// Constructs verified against zend_language_parser.y at the pinned 8.5
// reference build; additions to the 8.5 surface land here first, with a
// LEVEL marker, then in the parser.
